#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:64
#: 1e9593a8ad3941e587ad2ecd9fa631e2
msgid "Vehicle Setup"
msgstr "飞行器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:66
#: dce4f75520de4cf6869cee9cf71647a0
msgid ""
"Connect the RockBLOCK modem to a spare UART on the flight controller. Only "
"the +5V, RX, TX and GND lines need to be connected"
msgstr "将 RockBLOCK 调制解调器连接到飞控上的空闲 UART。只需连接 +5V、RX、TX 和 GND 线即可"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:67
#: 1ae3ffbdbfe74cc8a2590cf5c4dfeee3
msgid "Ensure the modem is activated in your RockBLOCK account"
msgstr "确保调制解调器已在您的 RockBLOCK 账户中激活"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:68
#: 2b43e7363ba54d0ab1f6951fcfabeec8
msgid ""
"Copy the `Ardupilot RockBLOCK Lua script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/RockBlock.lua>`__"
" to the flight controller's SD card."
msgstr ""
"将 `Ardupilot RockBLOCK Lua 脚本 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/RockBlock.lua>`__"
" 复制到飞控的 SD 卡中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:69
#: fa0212cd75f04c54abd948ce8c8d4140
msgid ""
"Ensure :ref:`LUA Scripts<common-lua-scripts>` are enabled and the RockBLOCK "
"UART is set as a scripting UART."
msgstr "确保已启用 :ref:`LUA 脚本<common-lua-scripts>` 并将 RockBLOCK UART 设置为脚本 UART。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:73
#: 4968e686604846638c4d5ac97e754026
msgid "Ground Setup"
msgstr "地面端设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:75
#: a010899e9863408ab139362123759a59
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK messages are sent and received via the Rock7 gateway. It has "
"an API that allows for sending and receiving messages via a web service."
msgstr "RockBLOCK 消息通过 Rock7 网关发送和接收。该网关提供 API，可通过 Web 服务发送和接收消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:78
#: 35ab70c43eff4227b4510aa4de29c13e
msgid ""
"The `Rockblock2MAV <https://github.com/stephendade/rockblock2mav>`__ "
"software is a companion to the RockBlock Lua script. Use this software on "
"the GCS to send and receive MAVLink messages from the RockBLOCK modem via "
"the Rock7 gateway."
msgstr ""
"`Rockblock2MAV <https://github.com/stephendade/rockblock2mav>`__ 软件是 "
"RockBlock Lua 脚本的配套工具。在地面站上使用此软件可通过 Rock7 网关向 RockBLOCK 调制解调器发送和接收 MAVLink "
"消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:81
#: 86597bcc45374fcf8c157a70aab2b8cf
msgid ""
"See the `Rockblock2MAV documentation "
"<https://github.com/stephendade/rockblock2mav>`__ for installation and usage"
" instructions."
msgstr ""
"有关安装和使用说明，请参阅 `Rockblock2MAV 文档 "
"<https://github.com/stephendade/rockblock2mav>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:83
#: d67427f5b2e94ed1b2cf228bc711f7ee
msgid ""
"QGroundControl and Mission Planner have limited support for RockBLOCK "
"MAVLink telemetry. It is recommended to use MAVProxy, which fully supports "
"this telemetry."
msgstr ""
"QGroundControl 和 Mission Planner 对 RockBLOCK MAVLink 数传的支持有限。建议使用 "
"MAVProxy，它完全支持此数传方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:87
#: 18c0e4713f9d44cfae79356995150f03
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:89
#: 3149477ffb5e4195b4580f8eee83ee08
msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`High Latency<common-MAVLink-high-latency>` mode on the flight "
"controller to start RockBLOCK mailbox checks."
msgstr "在飞控上启用 :ref:`高延迟<common-MAVLink-high-latency>` 模式以开始 RockBLOCK 邮箱检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:90
#: a4c0cf75b5254a47a08dfe70b4514e80
msgid ""
"The RockBLOCK will do a mailbox check every ``RCK_PERIOD`` seconds. It will "
"send one `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ message and "
"recieve one message from the GCS at this time."
msgstr ""
"RockBLOCK 将每隔 ``RCK_PERIOD`` 秒进行一次邮箱检查。此时将发送一条 `HIGH_LATENCY2 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HIGH_LATENCY2>`__ "
"消息，并从地面站接收一条消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:91
#: 19112b978da04fe3a6b1480850ec8c27
msgid ""
"Disable :ref:`High Latency<common-MAVLink-high-latency>` mode on the flight "
"controller to stop RockBLOCK mailbox checks."
msgstr "在飞控上禁用 :ref:`高延迟<common-MAVLink-high-latency>` 模式以停止 RockBLOCK 邮箱检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:95
#: 67ff6717ebcd4cb0b4ef4e291e1ac61b
msgid "Data Costs"
msgstr "数据费用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:97
#: bb05a63497a34ba79951ee2dfce2d5e3
msgid ""
"Compared to terrestrial services (such as 4G Celluar), the RockBLOCK data "
"costs are expensive."
msgstr "与地面服务（如 4G 蜂窝网络）相比，RockBLOCK 的数据费用较高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:99
#: a410e64f85284fb09a0bd3f6ed0861cb
msgid ""
"Current data costs are available from the `RockBlock website "
"<https://docs.rockblock.rock7.com/docs/iridium-contract-costs>`__."
msgstr ""
"当前数据费用可在 `RockBlock 官网 <https://docs.rockblock.rock7.com/docs/iridium-"
"contract-costs>`__ 查阅。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-rockblock.rst:101
#: b55fae81d2ec49e589dc2a0e74358527
msgid ""
"1 RockBLOCK credit is used per MAVLink message. So, for example, if the "
"RockBLOCK was configured to send 1 ``HIGH_LATENCY2`` message every 30 "
"seconds that would give a data usage of 120 credits per hour. If any "
"commands are sent from the GCS to the vehicle via the RockBLOCK, they should"
" be added too. For example, if 5 commands are sent in the same hour, 5 "
"credits are used. Combining both sent and recieved messages, a total of 125 "
"credits per hours are used."
msgstr ""
"每条 MAVLink 消息消耗 1 个 RockBLOCK 积分。例如，如果 RockBLOCK 配置为每 30 秒发送 1 条 "
"``HIGH_LATENCY2`` 消息，则每小时消耗 120 个积分。如果在同一小时内从地面站向飞行器通过 RockBLOCK "
"发送了命令，则应累加计算。例如，发送 5 条命令则额外消耗 5 个积分。合计发送和接收消息，每小时共消耗 125 个积分。"

